<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ concrete production up 7.1 pct in Dec qtr.</title>
<headline>NZ concrete production up 7.1 pct in Dec qtr.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand ready-mix concrete production increased by 7.1 percent in the December quarter compared to the same quarter of 1995 to reach 585,000 cubic metres, Statistics New Zealand said on Friday.</p>
<p>Over calendar 1996, ready mix production increased by 7.9 percent, SNZ said in its latest production statistics series.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
</text>
